Measure the height of a unit, at the body, not the front ears.
How tall is it?

A rack unit is 1.75"
IF the unit is less than 1.68" tall:
     Go to Home Depot, Lowes, or similar hardware place.
     Buy Qty. 1: 3/4" x 3/4" x 48" aluminum angle, 1/16" thick
Cut into 2 with hack saw
Drill holes to attach horizontally to rack posts.
Instant rack shelf..




